%[text] **\[1\]** Lighthill, M. J., & Whitham, G. B. (1955). On kinematic waves II. A theory of traffic flow on long crowded roads. *Proceedings of the Royal Society of London. Series A. Mathematical and Physical Sciences*, *229*(1178), 317-345. [https://doi.org/10.1098/rspa.1955.0089](https://doi.org/10.1098/rspa.1955.0089)
